# The build context of deploy/Dockerfile is the repository root. BuildKit reads this file instead of the root .dockerignore (which is the
# Storybook container's) for builds with -f deploy/Dockerfile: only what the server's build needs gets into the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!server
!src-tauri
**/target
**/node_modules
